 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Obsessive Second Male Lead Has Gone Wild (Pre-Serialization)"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "집착 서브 남주가 미쳐날뛴다"
   },
   {
    "ko-ro": "Jibchag Sub Namjuga Michyeonalddwinda"
   },
   {
    "zh": "执着的男配角已经疯狂了"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "I remembered the story of a novel I had read in my previous life just before my marriage. If I don't mess up the wedding, I'll be poisoned by my husband! So I just kissed the priest who was conducting the ceremony.\n\n\"Commander, are you alright?\" one of the holy knights shouted as he approached the priest who had been kissed.\n\n*Huh, what? Wait… are you the commander of the Holy Knights?*\n\n===\n\nRurutia, who was about to die, wanted to spend her last moments in a temple where she felt at ease the most. She started a business with her friends for the temple, and it was a big hit.\n\n\"Miss, you have the world in the palm of your hands!\"\n\n\"Are you a God who descended to earth?\"\n\nIn the midst of being embarrassed by the large crown, the commander of the holy knights himself was also acting strange.\n\n“All I wish for is to be your husband,\" he said with eyes shining from obsession, \"Take responsibility for stealing my first kiss.\"  \n  \n*This is all so wrong. It seems that I changed my future.*\n\n*Cover Artist: cocorip\nPromo Artist: Bomin\nNovel Illustrations: Waffle Candy.*"
  },
